      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-21T11:21:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To add more color here, you could argue \"how many interfaces you have\" is mostly a platform/compile time decision as well, but we have JSON configuration that phosphor-networkd uses to determine where to get the MAC addresses for each interface.  Please work towards this being a configuration, even if initially it is a static configuration in a JSON file, but I don\u0027t agree that platform configuration should be primarily configured through meson compile flags.",
      "parentUuid": "0fd7ea69_b3c2753f",
